    <title>实验1：热身运动——Hello World小程序</title>
    <link href="/2025/07/14/%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A/"/>
    <url>/2025/07/14/%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<center>姓名：贺凡思杰  学号：24020007043</center><table><thead><tr><th>姓名和学号？</th><th>贺凡思杰，24020007043</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>本实验属于哪门课程？</td><td>中国海洋大学26夏《移动软件开发》</td></tr><tr><td>实验名称？</td><td>实验1：热身运动</td></tr><tr><td>博客地址？</td><td><a href="https://commings-jie.github.io/">https://commings-jie.github.io/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Github仓库地址？</td><td><a href="https://github.com/Commings-Jie/weixin-xiaochengxu">https://github.com/Commings-Jie/weixin-xiaochengxu</a></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="一、实验内容"><a href="#一、实验内容" class="headerlink" title="一、实验内容"></a>一、实验内容</h2><h3 id="1-1-实验环境准备"><a href="#1-1-实验环境准备" class="headerlink" title="1.1 实验环境准备"></a>1.1 实验环境准备</h3><ul><li><strong>操作系统</strong>：Windows 11</li><li><strong>开发工具</strong>：微信开发者工具 Stable 2.02.2608040</li><li><strong>渲染模式</strong>：Webview（默认）</li></ul><h3 id="1-2-创建小程序项目"><a href="#1-2-创建小程序项目" class="headerlink" title="1.2 创建小程序项目"></a>1.2 创建小程序项目</h3><ol><li>在桌面创建空白文件夹 </li><li>打开微信开发者工具，点击”+”新建项目</li><li>填写项目名称，选择项目目录，填入 AppID</li><li>后端服务选择”不使用云服务”</li><li><strong>模板选择不使用模板</strong>（重要）</li><li>点击”新建”完成创建</li></ol><h3 id="1-3-Hello-World-小程序实现"><a href="#1-3-Hello-World-小程序实现" class="headerlink" title="1.3 Hello World 小程序实现"></a>1.3 Hello World 小程序实现</h3><p>按照官方视频教程，完成了一个包含图片展示、文字切换和按钮交互的 Hello World 小程序。</p><h4 id="1-3-1-项目文件结构"><a href="#1-3-1-项目文件结构" class="headerlink" title="1.3.1 项目文件结构"></a>1.3.1 项目文件结构</h4><figure class="highlight axapta"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs axapta">实验一微信小程序/<br>├── app.js                  <span class="hljs-meta"># 小程序入口逻辑</span><br>├── app.json                <span class="hljs-meta"># 全局配置（页面路由、导航栏）</span><br>├── app.wxss                <span class="hljs-meta"># 全局样式</span><br>├── img/<br>│   └── 爱芮.png            <span class="hljs-meta"># 页面展示图片</span><br>├── pages/<br>│   └── <span class="hljs-keyword">index</span>/<br>│       ├── <span class="hljs-keyword">index</span>.js        <span class="hljs-meta"># 首页逻辑（数据绑定、事件处理）</span><br>│       ├── <span class="hljs-keyword">index</span>.json      <span class="hljs-meta"># 页面配置</span><br>│       ├── <span class="hljs-keyword">index</span>.wxml      <span class="hljs-meta"># 页面模板（UI结构）</span><br>│       └── <span class="hljs-keyword">index</span>.wxss      <span class="hljs-meta"># 页面样式</span><br>├── project.config.json     <span class="hljs-meta"># 项目配置</span><br>└── sitemap.json            <span class="hljs-meta"># 站点地图</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="1-3-2-核心代码"><a href="#1-3-2-核心代码" class="headerlink" title="1.3.2 核心代码"></a>1.3.2 核心代码</h4><p><strong>页面模板（index.wxml）：</strong></p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs html"><span class="hljs-comment">&lt;!--index.wxml--&gt;</span><br><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">navigation-bar</span> <span class="hljs-attr">title</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello World&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">back</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;&#123;&#123;false&#125;&#125;&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">color</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;black&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">background</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;#FFF&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">navigation-bar</span>&gt;</span><br><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">scroll-view</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;scrollarea&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">scroll-y</span>&gt;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">view</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;container&quot;</span>&gt;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">image</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;my-image&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">mode</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;widthFix&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">src</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/img/爱芮.png&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">image</span>&gt;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">text</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;name-text&quot;</span>&gt;</span>&#123;&#123;charName&#125;&#125;<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">text</span>&gt;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">button</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;toggle-btn&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">bindtap</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;onToggle&quot;</span>&gt;</span>切换<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">button</span>&gt;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">view</span>&gt;</span><br><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">scroll-view</span>&gt;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>页面逻辑（index.js）：</strong></p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-comment">// index.js</span><br><span class="hljs-title class_">Page</span>(&#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-attr">data</span>: &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-attr">charName</span>: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;Hello World&#x27;</span>,<br>    <span class="hljs-attr">isSwitched</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">false</span><br>  &#125;,<br><br>  <span class="hljs-title function_">onToggle</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">setData</span>(&#123;<br>      <span class="hljs-attr">isSwitched</span>: !<span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">data</span>.<span class="hljs-property">isSwitched</span>,<br>      <span class="hljs-attr">charName</span>: <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">data</span>.<span class="hljs-property">isSwitched</span> ? <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;Hello World&#x27;</span> : <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;你好 世界！&#x27;</span><br>    &#125;)<br>  &#125;<br>&#125;)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>页面样式（index.wxss）：</strong></p><figure class="highlight css"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs css"><span class="hljs-comment">/**index.wxss**/</span><br>page &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">100vh</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">display</span>: flex;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">flex-direction</span>: column;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-selector-class">.scrollarea</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">flex</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-selector-class">.my-image</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">100%</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">400</span>rpx;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">margin-top</span>: <span class="hljs-number">20</span>rpx;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-selector-class">.name-text</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">display</span>: block;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">text-align</span>: center;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">font-size</span>: <span class="hljs-number">40</span>rpx;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">font-weight</span>: bold;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">color</span>: <span class="hljs-number">#ff69b4</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">margin-top</span>: <span class="hljs-number">24</span>rpx;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">margin-bottom</span>: <span class="hljs-number">32</span>rpx;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-selector-class">.toggle-btn</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">60%</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">80</span>rpx;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">line-height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">80</span>rpx;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">background</span>: <span class="hljs-number">#07c160</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">color</span>: <span class="hljs-number">#fff</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">font-size</span>: <span class="hljs-number">30</span>rpx;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">border-radius</span>: <span class="hljs-number">40</span>rpx;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">border</span>: none;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">margin</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span> auto;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>全局配置（app.json）：</strong></p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs json"><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;pages&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">[</span><br>    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;pages/index/index&quot;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;window&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;navigationBarTextStyle&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;black&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;navigationStyle&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;custom&quot;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;style&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;v2&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;sitemapLocation&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;sitemap.json&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="1-3-3-功能说明"><a href="#1-3-3-功能说明" class="headerlink" title="1.3.3 功能说明"></a>1.3.3 功能说明</h4><table><thead><tr><th>功能</th><th>实现方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>图片展示</td><td><code>&lt;image&gt;</code> 组件，<code>src=&quot;/img/爱芮.png&quot;</code>，<code>mode=&quot;widthFix&quot;</code></td></tr><tr><td>文字显示</td><td>数据绑定 <code>&#123;&#123;charName&#125;&#125;</code>，初始值为 “Hello World”</td></tr><tr><td>按钮交互</td><td><code>bindtap=&quot;onToggle&quot;</code> 绑定点击事件</td></tr><tr><td>文字切换</td><td><code>this.setData()</code> 更新数据，实现 “Hello World” ↔ “你好 世界！” 切换</td></tr><tr><td>样式美化</td><td>粉红色文字（<code>#ff69b4</code>）、绿色圆角按钮、Flex 布局</td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="1-3-4-运行效果"><a href="#1-3-4-运行效果" class="headerlink" title="1.3.4 运行效果"></a>1.3.4 运行效果</h4><p><strong>初始状态（显示 Hello World）：</strong></p><p><img src="/img/%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE1.png" srcset="/img/loading.gif" lazyload alt="初始状态"></p><p><strong>点击切换后（显示 你好 世界！）：</strong></p><p><img src="/img/%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE2.png" srcset="/img/loading.gif" lazyload alt="切换后状态"></p><h3 id="1-4-关键技术点"><a href="#1-4-关键技术点" class="headerlink" title="1.4 关键技术点"></a>1.4 关键技术点</h3><ol><li><strong>WXML（模板）</strong>：使用 <code>&#123;&#123;&#125;&#125;</code> 语法进行数据绑定，<code>bindtap</code> 绑定事件</li><li><strong>WXSS（样式）</strong>：使用 <code>rpx</code> 响应式单位，Flex 布局实现页面排版</li><li><strong>JS（逻辑）</strong>：通过 <code>Page()</code> 定义页面，<code>data</code> 存储数据，<code>setData()</code> 更新视图</li><li><strong>JSON（配置）</strong>：<code>app.json</code> 配置页面路由和全局窗口样式</li></ol><h2 id="二、问题总结与体会"><a href="#二、问题总结与体会" class="headerlink" title="二、问题总结与体会"></a>二、问题总结与体会</h2><h3 id="2-1-遇到的问题及解决方案"><a href="#2-1-遇到的问题及解决方案" class="headerlink" title="2.1 遇到的问题及解决方案"></a>2.1 遇到的问题及解决方案</h3><p><strong>问题1：图片不显示</strong></p><ul><li><strong>现象</strong>：添加 <code>&lt;image&gt;</code> 组件后，模拟器中图片无法显示</li><li><strong>原因</strong>：<ol><li><code>&lt;image&gt;</code> 标签放在了 <code>&lt;/scroll-view&gt;</code> 外面，在 Skyline 渲染模式下不会渲染</li><li><code>scroll-view</code> 设置了 <code>type=&quot;list&quot;</code>（虚拟列表），该模式下图片组件不渲染</li><li><code>overflow-y: hidden</code> 将图片内容裁剪</li></ol></li><li><strong>解决</strong>：<ol><li>将 <code>&lt;image&gt;</code> 移到 <code>scroll-view</code> 内部</li><li>去掉 <code>type=&quot;list&quot;</code> 属性</li><li>去掉 <code>overflow-y: hidden</code></li><li>图片路径使用绝对路径 <code>/img/爱芮.png</code></li><li>给图片设置明确的宽高</li></ol></li></ul><p><strong>问题2：Skyline 渲染模式兼容性问题</strong></p><ul><li><strong>现象</strong>：使用 Skyline 渲染器时，部分组件表现异常</li><li><strong>解决</strong>：在 <code>app.json</code> 中去掉 <code>renderer: &quot;skyline&quot;</code> 相关配置，使用默认的 Webview 渲染模式，兼容性更好</li></ul><h3 id="2-2-收获与体会"><a href="#2-2-收获与体会" class="headerlink" title="2.2 收获与体会"></a>2.2 收获与体会</h3><ol><li><strong>理解了小程序的四大文件</strong>：通过亲手编写代码，深刻体会到 <code>.js</code>（逻辑）、<code>.wxml</code>（结构）、<code>.wxss</code>（样式）、<code>.json</code>（配置）各自的作用和协作方式</li><li><strong>掌握了数据绑定机制</strong>：<code>&#123;&#123;&#125;&#125;</code> 语法和 <code>setData()</code> 方法是小程序数据驱动视图的核心</li><li><strong>熟悉了事件处理</strong>：<code>bindtap</code> 绑定点击事件，在 JS 中定义对应函数处理交互</li><li><strong>了解了渲染模式差异</strong>：Skyline 和 Webview 两种渲染模式在组件支持上有差异，开发时需要注意兼容性</li><li><strong>学会了使用微信开发者工具</strong>：包括项目创建、代码编辑、编译预览、调试等基本操作</li></ol><h3 id="2-3-对课程的建议"><a href="#2-3-对课程的建议" class="headerlink" title="2.3 对课程的建议"></a>2.3 对课程的建议</h3><p>希望后续实验能有更多实战项目，逐步增加难度，从简单的页面展示到复杂的数据交互和 API 调用，帮助我们系统掌握小程序开发技能。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
